{"id":"apagado","lemma":"apagado","pos":"adj","rank":4328,"glosses":["either idle or broken; inoperative; disabled; switched off","hardly perceptible; faint"],"ipa":"/ɐ.pɐˈɡa.du/","forms":{"feminine":"apagada","masculinePlural":"apagados","femininePlural":"apagadas","superlative":"o mais apagado"},"examples":[{"text":"A luz está apagada.","en":"The light is off.","words":[{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"light"},{"g":"is","l":"estar"},null]},{"text":"As luzes estão apagadas.","en":"The lights are out.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"light","l":"luz"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null]},{"text":"Noite passada, fui dormir com as luzes apagadas.","en":"Last night, I went to sleep with the lights on.","words":[{"g":"night"},{"g":"step"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to sleep"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"light","l":"luz"},null]},{"text":"Você se lembrou de ter apagado as luzes?","en":"Did you remember to turn off the lights?","words":[{"g":"you (formal)"},{"g":"if / oneself"},{"g":"to remember","l":"lembrar"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to own"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"light","l":"luz"}]},{"text":"As luzes estavam apagadas.","en":"The lights were off.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"light","l":"luz"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null]}]}